# ~/.claude is symlinked to this directory and also holds runtime state
# (history, transcripts, caches, plugins, synced skills).
# Ignore everything by default; only allowlisted config is tracked.
*

!.gitignore
!settings.json
!CLAUDE.md
!agents/
!agents/**
!commands/
!commands/**
!statusline.sh
!notify.sh
!themes/
!themes/**
!skills/
!skills/**
skills/synced/
